    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated on the fourth floor of Shelbourne Plaza, this attractive apartment enjoys a superb outlook over the River Liffey and benefits from a large private balcony, offering an excellent outdoor space with fine views. The property is bright and well proportioned throughout and comes with gas-fired central heating, excellent storage and the added benefit of a designated parking space in the secure underground car park. There is also lift access to all floors and an intercom system serving the main entrance.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, with Dublin city centre within easy walking distance and an excellent choice of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops and leisure facilities close by. Grand Canal Dock and Hanover Quay are easily accessed via the development’s side entrance, while the Bord Gáis Energy Theatre, National Convention Centre, Aviva Stadium and RDS are all nearby. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with the DART and numerous Dublin Bus routes providing easy access throughout the city and beyond. Ringsend, Sandymount and Ballsbridge are also within easy reach. A number of major international and professional employers are located nearby, including Google, Airbnb, Indeed and Meta, together with leading professional firms such as Mason Hayes & Curran and William Fry. A Dublin Bikes station located at the entrance further enhances the convenience of this excellent city-centre location.\r\n\r\nSpacious accommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway with two storage rooms, living room / dining room, kitchen, two double bedrooms (master ensuite and main bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway\r\nRecessed lighting, timber flooring and two generously proportioned storage rooms.\r\n\r\nLiving Room / Dining Room\r\nApprox. 4.7m x 3.1m\r\nA bright and spacious reception room with timber flooring and floor-to-ceiling windows enjoying fine views over the River Liffey. A door provides direct access to the large private balcony, which also enjoys attractive views.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nApprox. 2.9m x 2.0m\r\nFitted kitchen with a range of built-in cupboards and drawers, integrated oven and hob, fridge freezer, washing machine and one-and-a-half-bowl stainless steel sink unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nApprox. 5.2m x 2.6m\r\nGenerously sized double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, timber flooring and views over the River Liffey.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite\r\nComprises WC, pedestal wash hand basin and fully tiled step-in shower unit, with fully tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nApprox. 4.1m x 2.6m\r\nDouble bedroom with built-in wardrobes, timber flooring and views over the River Liffey.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nComprises WC, wash hand basin and bath. Fully tiled walls and floor with heated towel rail."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Special Features\r\n\r\n• Superb city-centre location within walking distance of a host of amenities\r\n• Fourth-floor apartment\r\n• Lift access to all floors\r\n• Large private balcony with fine views over the River Liffey\r\n• One designated parking space in secure underground car park\r\n• Gas-fired central heating\r\n• Excellent storage\r\n• Intercom system\r\n• Master bedroom with en-suite\r\n• Bright and well-proportioned accommodation"
      },
      {
